; map 54 (zone 3 area 6): old Hercule beside Trunks, talked to (Ryan, 2026-11-01): player 1's character asks, he
; laughs it off (nothing may reveal him). Krillin's own portrait when player 1 is Krillin, else the lead's box.
sequence ch1_old_hercule_talk
  script                                 ; player 1 Krillin -> 2, else 1
        PlayAudio 50
        PushActiveCharIndex
        PushByte 6
        CmpEq
        JumpIfFalse L1
        PushByte 2
        END
      L1:
        PushByte 1
        END
  fmt 1 "%s: Who are you?" -> 3
        PushActiveCharNameUpper
        END
  text 73 "KRILLIN: Who are you?"
  text 126 "OLD HERCULE: Ha ha ha!  Oh, don't worry, kid, you'll find out!"
end

